  "description": "The meme presents a false and misleading historical claim that the bones of anti-Nazi German women are still in the crematorium ovens at Buchenwald, which is factually inaccurate. This distortion of history is intended to provoke shock and outrage, but it also serves to minimize the scale of the Holocaust atrocities and potentially promote Holocaust denial. The overall intent is harmful as it misrepresents the purpose of the crematorium and distorts the historical record.",
